  "NoSlop is a privacy-first, serverless mesh network and content aggregator. It routes all communication over Tor by default and keeps your identity cryptographically secure on your device.": "NoSlop 是一个注重隐私的无服务器网状网络与内容聚合器。默认通过 Tor 加密路由所有网络流量，并将您的身份密码学安全地保存在本地设备上。",
  "NoSlop is entirely free and open-source. If you enjoy using it, consider buying Gabby (the founder) a coffee! Your support helps cover development time.": "NoSlop 完全免费且开源。如果您喜欢它，不妨请创始人 Gabby 喝杯咖啡！您的赞助支持独立开发。",
  "NoSlop needs access to the camera to scan contact node QR codes and initiate handshakes.": "NoSlop 需要相机权限来扫描联系人节点的二维码并建立安全握手连接。",
  "NoSlop requires the Tor daemon for mesh gossip and secure DMs. Embedded daemon failed to start or connect.": "NoSlop 需要 Tor 守护进程来进行网络通信与安全私信。内置守护进程启动或连接失败。",
  "NoSlop routes everything through Tor when 'Route Clearnet via Tor' is enabled.\nYou can toggle this setting in Settings anytime.": "开启“通过 Tor 路由明网流量”后，NoSlop 会将所有通信穿透 Tor 进行匿名保护。\n您可以随时在设置中切换此项。",
  "NoSlop routes everything through Tor when 'Route Clearnet via Tor' is enabled. You can toggle this setting in Settings anytime.": "开启“通过 Tor 路由明网流量”后，所有通信都将经由 Tor 网络。您可以随时在设置中更改此项。",
